          {
            "title": "Question 1",
            "id": 75856,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Qual é a palavra-chave que decide se um bloco de código deve ser executado ou não?</p><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>if</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>when</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>for</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>if</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Um jogo deve exibir uma mensagem somente quando <code>game_over</code> for <code>True</code>. Qual linha deve iniciar essa verificação?</p><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>if game_over:</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>when game_over:</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>for game_over:</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>if game_over:</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example 5",
            "id": 75894,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Codifique a variável que exibe <code>\"Take an umbrella\"</code> no console.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"is_rainy = \" /><text value=\"True\" class=\"literal\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"is_sunny = \" /><text value=\"False\" class=\"literal\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" is_rainy:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Take an umbrella&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"36\" endIndex=\"44\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"is_sunny\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Take an umbrella\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>is_rainy</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Defina <code>is_rainy</code> para seu bloco executar. Use a variável como condição para exibir <code>Take an umbrella</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"is_rainy = \" /><text value=\"True\" class=\"literal\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"is_sunny = \" /><text value=\"False\" class=\"literal\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" is_rainy:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Take an umbrella&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"36\" endIndex=\"44\" /><option startIndex=\"11\" endIndex=\"15\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"is_sunny\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"False\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Take an umbrella\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>True</code> seguido de <code>is_rainy</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question 6",
            "id": 75863,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Que tipo de valor usamos como condição para uma instrução if?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Booleano</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">String</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Número</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher Booleano.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Você pode usar um booleano armazenado como condição de uma instrução <code>if</code>.</p><p>A variável <code>is_open</code> armazena <code>False</code>. Qual expressão fornece esse valor?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>is_open</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>\"is_open\"</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>0</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>is_open</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question 5",
            "id": 75864,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Com base na indentação, quando <code>print(\"Starting game ...\")</code> será executado?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"character = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Wizard&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" character == \" /><text value=\"&quot;Knight&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\": \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Weapon: sword&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Starting game ...&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Sempre, independentemente de o bloco <code>if</code> ser executado, pois está indentado no mesmo nível</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Somente quando o bloco <code>if</code> é executado</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Nunca, porque este código gera um <code>IndentationError</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Sempre, independentemente de o bloco <code>if</code> ser executado, pois está indentado no mesmo nível.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Você executa este código com <code>character</code> definido como <code>\"Wizard\"</code>. O que ele exibe?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"character = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Wizard&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" character == \" /><text value=\"&quot;Knight&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\": \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Weapon: sword&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Starting game ...&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Somente <code>Starting game ...</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>Weapon: sword</code>, depois <code>Starting game ...</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Nada, porque a condição é <code>False</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Somente <code>Starting game ...</code></p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question 4",
            "id": 75858,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Como chamamos as instruções que executam ou pulam código dependendo de uma condição ser <code>True</code> ou <code>False</code>?</p><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Instruções if</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Declarações Else</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Loops for</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Instruções if.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>is_member</code> armazena <code>False</code>. O que <code>if is_member:</code> faz com a mensagem de boas-vindas indentada?</p><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Ignora a mensagem de boas-vindas.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Exibe a mensagem porque is_member existe.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Exibe False em vez da mensagem.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Ignora a mensagem de boas-vindas.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Correct answers",
            "id": 76588,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>O que este código exibe?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"name = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Sue&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" name == \" /><text value=\"&quot;Sue&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Hi Sue!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"Hi Sue!\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>Hi Sue!</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Nada, a condição é <code>False</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>Sue</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>Hi Sue!</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Por que este código exibe <code>Hi Sue!</code>?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"name = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Sue&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" name == \" /><text value=\"&quot;Sue&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Hi Sue!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"Hi Sue!\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">A comparação é <code>True</code>, então o <code>print()</code> indentado é executado.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">A comparação altera <code>name</code> para <code>\"Sue\"</code>.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">O <code>print()</code> é executado independentemente da condição porque está fora do bloco.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">A comparação é <code>True</code>, então o <code>print()</code> indentado é executado.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Condition",
            "id": 76566,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>O que este código exibe?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"weather = \" /><text value=\"&quot;rainy&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"color_code = \" /><text value=\"&quot;yellow&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" weather == \" /><text value=\"&quot;rainy&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  color_code = \" /><text value=\"&quot;blue&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(color_code)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"blue\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>blue</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>yellow</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>color_code</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>blue</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Por que este código exibe <code>blue</code> em vez de <code>yellow</code>?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"weather = \" /><text value=\"&quot;rainy&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"color_code = \" /><text value=\"&quot;yellow&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" weather == \" /><text value=\"&quot;rainy&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  color_code = \" /><text value=\"&quot;blue&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(color_code)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"blue\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">A condição é <code>True</code>, então <code>color_code</code> muda antes de ser exibido.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">A condição é <code>False</code>, então <code>color_code</code> mantém seu primeiro valor.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>print()</code> exibe o nome da variável em vez do valor atual.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">A condição é <code>True</code>, então <code>color_code</code> muda antes de ser exibido.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Wrong answers",
            "id": 76544,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Codifique uma condição que execute a instrução de exibição apenas se <code>character</code><em>não</em> for igual a <code>\"Wizard\"</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"character = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Wizard&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" character != \" /><text value=\"&quot;Wizard&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\": \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;You can't use spells&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"25\" endIndex=\"34\" /><option startIndex=\"35\" endIndex=\"37\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"==\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>character</code> seguido de <code>!=</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>O bloco só deve executar quando <code>character</code> <em>não</em> for <code>\"Wizard\"</code>. Monte a verificação para esta execução não imprimir nada.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"character = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Wizard&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" character != \" /><text value=\"&quot;Wizard&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\": \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;You can't use spells&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"25\" endIndex=\"34\" /><option startIndex=\"35\" endIndex=\"37\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"==\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"=\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>character</code> seguido de <code>!=</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Correct answers",
            "id": 76553,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Codifique um operador para tornar a condição <code>True</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"account = \" /><text value=\"&quot;premium&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" account == \" /><text value=\"&quot;premium&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\": \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Exclude from data set&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"31\" endIndex=\"33\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Exclude from data set\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>==</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Good decisions",
            "id": 76564,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Por que comparações são condições melhores do que apenas <code>True</code> ou <code>False</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Porque o valor das variáveis pode mudar, então pode executar ou pular um bloco de código dependendo do valor</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Não podemos usar comparação como condições</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Porque eles são sempre <code>True</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Porque o valor das variáveis pode mudar, então pode executar ou pular um bloco de código dependendo do valor.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Um aplicativo de clima deve exibir um alerta somente quando <code>temperature &gt; 30</code>. Por que usar essa comparação como condição em vez de <code>True</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">O resultado pode mudar com <code>temperature</code>, então o alerta pode ser executado ou pulado.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Uma comparação impede que o código do alerta seja executado.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Uma comparação sempre produz <code>True</code>.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">O resultado pode mudar com <code>temperature</code>, então o alerta pode ser executado ou pulado.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
